# MetaGPT: The Multi-Agent Framework

<p align="center">
<a href=""><img src="docs/resources/MetaGPT-new-log.png" alt="MetaGPT logo: Enable GPT to work in software company, collaborating to tackle more complex tasks." width="150px"></a>
